NOTE ON DATA LICENSING

This licence covers the CODE in this repository only.

The data this analysis consumes is licensed by its original providers and is
NOT relicensed here. No raw DepMap, CTRP, Cell Model Passports or TCGA file is
redistributed in this repository; data/download.R fetches them from source and
verifies each against a SHA-256 recorded in data/MANIFEST.csv, which also names
each source's licence.

Files under data/derived/ are DERIVED objects — score matrices and model
outputs computed from those sources — not copies of the source data. They are
committed so the analysis reproduces without a 5.5 GB download. Anyone reusing
them remains bound by the terms of the underlying providers.
